          <p>
            At typical big-box and dealer prices, entry lawn tractors start around $1,500 to $2,200, mid-range tractors and entry zero-turns run roughly $2,500 to $4,000, and premium residential tractors, garden tractors and well-built zero-turns run from about $4,000 up to $7,000 or more. Electric riding mowers generally sit in the upper half of that range for a given deck size. These are typical ranges rather than quotes, and seasonal sales move them noticeably.
          </p>

