              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">$4-7k+</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Premium and garden tractors</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-[#38BDF8]">$150-300</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Typical yearly running cost (gas)</p>
